          <attvalue for="1" value="Circularity/Recycling - Plastic &amp; Packaging" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="At least 20% of the carbon used in the chemical and plastic products should be from sustainable non-fossil sources by 2030, in full consideration of the EU's biodiversity and circular economy objectives and of the upcoming policy framework for bio-based, biodegradable and compostable plastics. Communication on Sustainable Carbon Cycles" />
