          <attvalue for="1" value="Biodiversity Protection &amp; Conservation" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="Terrestrial, coastal and freshwater ecosystems. Member States shall put in place the restoration measures for the terrestrial, coastal and freshwater habitats of the species listed in Annexes II, IV and V" />
