          <attvalue for="1" value="Terrestrial Ecosystems Restoration" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="4. By 2030, significant areas of degraded and carbon-rich ecosystems are restored. Habitats and species show no deterioration in conservation trends and status, and at least 30% reach favourable conservation status or at least show a positive trend." />
